redistribution=object-code-only, solely for use with Cypress integrated circuit products
redistribution-scope=selected only by the Raspberry Pi 4 image configuration, whose BCM43455 is a Cypress integrated circuit
modification=forbidden by the licence; the installed bytes equal the verified upstream bytes
reverse-engineering=forbidden by the licence; the driver searches the firmware for its version string, converts the NVRAM text into the chip's key=value form in memory and sends the CLM in chunks, and does not analyse the code
export-control=the licence's Compliance With Law paragraph applies
license=Cypress Wireless Connectivity Devices Driver End User License Agreement in the installed LICENCE.cypress file; the NVRAM values are also available under GPL-2.0+ (installed GPL-2)
